Work runs on tiers ([_shared/model-routing.md](../_shared/model-routing.md)). Before a plan or any dispatch, read this IDE's tier map: [adapters/cursor/model-usage.md](../adapters/cursor/model-usage.md), or [adapters/gpt/model-usage.md](../adapters/gpt/model-usage.md) when the picker is a GPT model. `.mdc` rules load only in Cursor; other IDEs: [adapters/README.md](../adapters/README.md).
Every dispatch names its `model` from that map; never omit it. The adapter's `deepLane` says whether deep runs inline or is dispatched.
Verbs for IDE actions: [_shared/harness-verbs.md](../_shared/harness-verbs.md).
